sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EB as EventBridge<br/>(nightly / hourly / event)
    participant Sup as Supervisor<br/>(Strands)
    participant DR as Data & Retrieval
    participant FS as Feature Store<br/>(Iceberg + DDB)
    participant RR as Regime Router
    participant FC as Forecasting Agent
    participant SM as SageMaker<br/>(LightGBM / Chronos)
    participant PE as Policy Engine
    participant GR as Guardrail & Approval
    participant Q as Approval Queue
    participant WB as Writeback Agent
    participant eMRO as eMRO<br/>Writeback REST
    participant Audit as Audit S3

    EB->>Sup: optimize(tenant, pn, location)
    activate Sup
    Sup->>DR: fetch_bundle(pn, location)
    activate DR
    DR->>FS: get_part / demand_history / interchange / open_orders
    FS-->>DR: PartLocationBundle
    DR-->>Sup: PartLocationBundle
    deactivate DR

    Sup->>RR: classify(bundle, previous_regime)
    activate RR
    RR-->>Sup: RegimeClassification
    deactivate RR

    Sup->>FC: forecast(regime, bundle)
    activate FC
    FC->>SM: invoke champion model
    SM-->>FC: raw forecast
    FC-->>Sup: ForecastDistribution<br/>(mean, variance, p50, p95, p99)
    deactivate FC

    Sup->>PE: recommend(forecast, lead_time_dist,<br/>service_level, constraints)
    activate PE
    Note over PE: deterministic —<br/>base-stock / (s,S) / (R,Q)<br/>+ interchange rollup<br/>+ shelf-life / hazmat clamps
    PE-->>Sup: PolicyRecommendation<br/>+ provenance_id
    deactivate PE

    Sup->>GR: evaluate(recommendation)
    activate GR
    Note over GR: 1. Hard guardrails<br/>(delta, floor, AOG, shelf)<br/>2. Killswitch<br/>3. Tier resolution (A/B/C)
    alt Hard guardrail violated
        GR->>Q: enqueue(priority, reason)
        GR-->>Sup: REJECTED_HARD_GUARDRAIL
    else Tier A (advisor)
        GR->>Q: enqueue(priority)
        GR-->>Sup: QUEUED_FOR_APPROVAL
    else Tier B or C
        GR-->>Sup: APPROVED_FOR_WRITE
    end
    deactivate GR

    opt Tier B/C approved for write
        Sup->>WB: write(recommendation, idempotency_key)
        activate WB
        WB->>eMRO: PUT /v1/tenants/{id}/inventory-level/{pn}/{loc}<br/>Idempotency-Key + mTLS + JWT
        eMRO->>eMRO: Transactional update<br/>+ PN_INVENTORY_LEVEL_HISTORY
        eMRO-->>WB: 200 {old, new, written_at}
        WB-->>Sup: WritebackResult
        deactivate WB
    end

    Sup->>Audit: mirror decision + provenance
    deactivate Sup

    Note right of Audit: 7-year retention<br/>S3 Object Lock Compliance
